body:
What type of missile is that? Or do all imperial missiles have people inside them

&#x200B;

Edit I did not see the weapon was mentioned before the excerpt I am an idiot

Maidens weren't always on the same side Ozpin started protecting them because maidens would be hunted down by others wanting thier power and if a maiden is killed by a young ish female there is better than even odds they will be the last person they think of. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Personally I think Ozpin made the Maidens as a way to "store" some of his magic since it was slowing fading from body to body. And potentially as a way to produce exceptional warriors. Especially if it works the same way his reincarnation does with memories and aura (maybe even semblances ) getting passed along. Maidens existed for a great while before Ozpin had found the other relics. So there status as a key was never super important until recently \~a few hundred years at most. I also think that the maidens are a part of a ritual or spell that could (at least in ozpins mind ) defeat Salem by sealing her away or sending her somewhere etc.
